Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|layout.parallel.render.enable=false|
		|extraapps.plugins.includes|content-targeting|
		|ignore.errors|IX_DC6100CC|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|false|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.component.names|Content Targeting|
		|testray.main.component.name|Content Targeting|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When Portlet shutdown Server
	And Portlet start Server
	And User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Global User Segment To Site Via User Segment Content Display Portlet
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Global|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|User Segment Description|
		|userSegmentName|Male Users|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add User Attributes Gender Rule CP
		|genderRadio|Male|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add With Category CP
		|categoryName|Male Users|
		|vocabularyName|User Segment|
		|webContentContent|Web Content targeted to a User Segment|
		|webContentTitle|Targeted Web Content Title|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit CP
		|webContentTitle|Targeted Web Content Title|
	And WebContent view Categorization Category CP
		|categoryNameList|Male Users|
		|vocabularyName|User Segment|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|User Segment Content Display|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet configure Display Content
		|belongs|true|
		|contentTitle|Targeted Web Content Title|
		|contentType|Basic Web Content|
		|rowNumber|1|
		|siteScope|Global|
		|toAll|true|
		|userSegmentName|Male Users|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet save PG
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet view Entry PG
		|belongsTo|true|
		|viewUserSegmentSelected|Male Users|
Scenario: Add Parent Site User Segment To Child Site Via User Segment Content Display Portlet
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|parentSiteName|Site Name|
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site search Input CP
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|User Segment Description|
		|userSegmentName|Male Users|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add User Attributes Gender Rule CP
		|genderRadio|Male|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Child SiteName|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|User Segment Description|
		|userSegmentName|Male Non Users|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add User Attributes Gender Rule CP
		|genderRadio|Male|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Child SiteName|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add With Category CP
		|categoryName|Male Non Users|
		|userSegmentSelectChildSite|true|
		|vocabularyName|User Segment|
		|webContentContent|Targeted Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Targeted Web Content Title|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit CP
		|webContentTitle|Targeted Web Content Title|
	And WebContent view Categorization Category CP
		|categoryNameList|Male Non Users|
		|vocabularyName|User Segment|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|User Segment Content Display|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet configure Display Content
		|belongs|true|
		|contentTitle|Targeted Web Content Title|
		|contentType|Basic Web Content|
		|rowNumber|1|
		|siteScope|Site Name|
		|toAll|true|
		|userSegmentName|Male Users|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet save PG
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	Then UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet view Entry PG
		|belongsTo|true|
		|viewUserSegmentSelected|Male Users|
