Scenario: User Segment Content View Report
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|User Segment Description|
		|userSegmentName|Male Users|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add User Attributes Gender Rule CP
		|genderRadio|Male|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|WC Male Content View|
		|webContentTitle|WC Male View Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|WC Male View Title|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|User Segment Content Display|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet configure Display Content
		|belong|true|
		|contentTitle|WC Male View Title|
		|contentType|Basic Web Content|
		|rowNumber|1|
		|toAny|true|
		|userSegmentName|Male Users|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet save PG
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet view Entry PG
		|entryContentText|WC Male Content View|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment goto View Report
		|reportName|Content Views|
		|userSegmentName|Male Users|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment view Report Content Views
		|reportsContentTableList|Test Page Name,Page,View,10|
		|reportTitle|Test Page Name|
	Then ContentTargetingUserSegment view Report Content Views
		|reportsContentTableList|WC Male View Title,Web Content Article,View,6|
		|reportTitle|WC Male View Title|
